  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "仁政不暴，鳳凰來舍。四時順節，民安其居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ef5559033da836064a3810f8decfac6b2b5f672e4b7956c43a250a6989e50af6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:25330e98c6e9b138fbc7efe9cd65edaa5383d0912a557c51860b72579262b62a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "八口九頭，長舌破家。帝辛沈湎，商滅其墟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3f86dfc9a5e0744c996aeb9f039d15cab79d346f9325dee014401a944554b882",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d62b6aecce337984855316a8e1ccfcfd4aa885f274b8228758c1635fcc8c5ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "鬼守我門，呼伯入山。去其室家，捨其兆墓。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47a63bce987f1028e4997e31016bdd00aa3ffce18b283775bb93b8ac2cc58950",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7d213dadd3d53febba7b8e4e98e6d0efa4443544ea935d0fad2a4abd2b4809d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "日出阜東，山蔽其明。章甫薦履，箕子佯狂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:21285f7661bc44e696129a7f30e962cbe184069f700afee53b4fcfb7a57a1e95",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:99bf4da1d6c24e30e0a6dcac1ab1429f086eac96cf730c13ac7f712d21f35203"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "戴盆望天，不見星辰。顧小失大，福逃牆外。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:967e5a2825627155ccbd90d43d6702eb7579f09997d167dda868669fd9c857d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fe8782e845cee3a102df8eda98571f3d64b2765621a57de25fc106fca35b6b1c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "兩輪日轉，南上大阪。四馬共轅，無有重難。與語笑言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d8f85979c5edbc04ff2b7704c35ba089676ab16dd49cc0c9dca1a9317565dd07",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d346d717bf57d20b17a83a16666992664fdfc225961d148b97d60fc31bf04f48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "羊驚狼虎，聳耳群聚。行旅稽難，留連愁苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b718a9e4976097291d724f6589b2b170382880223798bc1bc5dc4ebd291c1d43",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa9ffb8c4294a909ca5f3e64c27b68ac55b7c47c427086e21593e8c32d4ec285"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "楩生荊山，命制輸班。袍衣剝脫，夏熱冬寒。飢餓枯槁，眾人莫憐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ef557d8c98ffb452b7b33d32c2d7c5f940b5530e7b481fff853d78f34d69a390",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7d04c237dc89a2c102c0e2edc199d46d427527c158a68b1e23b59f512f398f5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "鳥飛無翼，兔走折足。不常其德，自為羞辱。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a2c0016fdf094835cad377674b94221743406baf9f55440d223494782d8cbc92",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:68d474469b6dbe91d678a1ca76c60c374cb9715ae62af8dbb613f4ea302fb6d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "條風制氣，萬物出生。明庶長養，花葉壯茂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59d0c46de218ed988a94770ecca387aed2d000fd30753e20ac140b5715e3fbf6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:54498339a123d4021a6cc6764eb1ba63429606d64a041e954635d8c5055eac2f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "坤厚地德，萬物蕃息。平康正直，以綏大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f50a29a81233fe8b35c57e7680123c524ffb9c4b057610641ce52d745266238e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0b39329e22af43d4278df384bb8c9bd64632a6c152e2e7829d4fabbe65dc9626"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "昴畢附耳，將軍乘怒。路徑隔塞，燕雀驚駭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc8d4e5ced9bb720caef4e83f8de98e6086edbdbaf2427d2627f533b025e41e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8be269a5e2dd2860b733ea8394605c565fe41750ae44635de9e563b1ee1d3586"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "東風啟戶，黔啄翻舞。各樂其類，咸得生處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a844d58a9b483cc1538b193c8453690108225da85a5cec5171ee8d24bbd052c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8651871631e94c02c3b25e7c6fea1ee674d8e0df6702ef30e0185c484ecb9165"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "兩足四翼，飛入家國。寧我伯姊，與母相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e9c4b3ea6809c323119cce449d9e8a029a1d1da72dbdb81bf95c430f86d56a6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ea67150e556d771e1b20b1d1a023b33f6bd627ac02f1337ded14e105afbe4d3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "歲暮花落，陽入陰室。萬物伏匿，歲不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:79ac603b33a72ec7e1b9a61995ecb1b040c57bf07c648ff9f4221f03b66f9fb2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4fb9d49eaccb05b7e60a0681f00990483764a84e91ce8c326276ab0726388771"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "釋然遠咎，避患高阜。田獲三狐，以貝為寶。君子所在，安寧不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:67858ac151deb2ebc29b919938b7afc583f1e791d2516144c64c82d8450f2376",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:02ca41082edf71ed286eb169e4e83f003c3effb9f1b6ef5df2b7fc7284137875"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "遷延卻縮，不見頭目，日以困急。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eeba597aa696942e44d10e044236bff7a70efcccce91af169a0e4dc82e3439ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd943d04d595a3d1b240daf19eccd7fd96b5fba8eb9340f29db6e865fab085a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "秋隼冬翔，數被嚴霜。雄犬夜鳴，家擾不寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:11d647f044a263405706da75b243f13374fa71e6e54a2c6c7c811756fd2f356d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8c6d5aa800787921972f0eb420a4e58605d6d1ae0c4c0249836b140efbcf7579"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "班馬還師，以息勞疲。役夫嘉喜，入室見妻。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec25d49a340e0bc0f14f82ee185b32ffb0bea02e4545467ebaac40c7a7a279ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a04f3c33f9acc9f5c10400bb4946b77a113185c1271219af760eb18a9433c13c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "老楊日衰，條多枯枝。爵級不進，遂至摧隤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d4286eea64b478c151094076adc97a926d73475026f7a11bd4ff47bee1038714",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bda907bf798f81a97798c933cb6fbace89030d4e716a201cbbff7a1a87d8046a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "順風吹火，牽騎驥尾。易為功力，因懼受福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a2284df4e56d1fbe13d7ff4cc832c1bb01214d71b867379ee6225fdb5f567e4e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a4509332e0e9d3f0cdabd277587d5ff86f29ad3ff002294521cbc7bb08a95cb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "六人俱行，各遺其囊。黃鵠失珠，無以為明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f63297bdf7ae1b68cca6f25c4b6c9239714a3039e55063d61f415290691bf61c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2db66279610034b663bf47662e284f567dffc7aab34ddfb8caa83d553a1048e3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "依叔牆隅，志下心勞。楚王晨食，韓子低頭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:50df84bb3ca4618206da8727e2864608edba85075c41faee3a1aebcf7a83665c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae45379c3780d400a47bdfa6f4a20a14e26a8cc0be9e993437f000a50581156a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "三年生狗，以戌為母。荊夷上侵，姬伯出走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5f4ee62c8c4cfc6ff6fb2362584bb48f26b93dbf5a9f3c8fef3151550c13c27b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:53387b306303355a330459c8130e4c8e53d5edc65a720a13251d48f506b71fb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "鶴盜我珠，逃於東都。鵠起追求，郭氏之墟。不見蹤跡，反為禍災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d31666a99737e31332e0a24919a41f09e70707724ffa805f619edc3e1e424ff8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3298e339df7c5da850356e4058a37eddbcb8f1164f6fa839e362e65b145541d1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "外與中退，舉事不遂。餔麋毀齒，失其道理。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:67ad7b5a79a6734d4b7859f8b56f4c309e80f8cea8ced623439340f52bb436e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4592dbd4a5bfcc6eefaff542e28b0a0b9b1a70db7760fd63397d21806bbb6b49"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "鴻鵠高飛，鳴求其雌。雌來在戶，雄哺嘻嘻。甚獨勞苦，炮鱉膾鯉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bee6546e009688ed3d782f0b0dd142c2694569e482d630a780160256c3ff1379",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:245775308698ffaae3be8892ec658968b2c16ed368cb6d10734888af356e62de"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "褰衣涉河，水深漬衣。幸賴舟子，濟脫無他。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de717b2cd64947df56aed94ed8fb360695d4e1d0791d3f02d2c79eccb6cac837",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50724a4b64f942cdee8c87eeb45f30642aa2830827785f9cbe04272aaa3571ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "虎齧龍指，泰山之崖。天命不佑，不見其雌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e6f8dc7e0331872cd117efafe3a93eb895c1d84a63b690d141d29f705068497b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:83aa758637ad2f5241b96c7fa4933d759563ad360513153cfa08e47b0fe632a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "明不處暗，智不履危。終年卒歲，樂以笑歌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7541059d541b14115d0e8bb29c9bf39f560ebc2597c9edde18f1a2b7ed081a82",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4bf0e9a1c2f71306a1845a76e5904bd2e7d56458e0ab3e0b6c63ea9f6f96b8cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "三足俱行，傾危善僵。六指不便，慁累弟兄。樹柱閡車，失其正當。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7f329c96264045f8b70e80e7f3f60e4e9019ed013793810ed7b4afc782460ca3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebc7b36f1314ac1b077323a53f4563e32030cdc396418ebd33c9c18f43dd92a5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "含車而徒，亡其駁牛。雖喪白頭，酒以療憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6c2ac8459bce1991162e76906527e86350ae2d2eebfd350e9781ed74a4b3de37",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fde01e452daf2966cb2e32c97c7f3be6920224cf7378cffce9435ce713806324"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "析薪熾酒，使媒求婦。和合齊宋，姜子悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d3b4c9f40cb9df195df4ae92be58fe02cc724020bdc1d334fd5c82c34e890438",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:29834248a98fee4e158e39ec2c262cd1a2309bc091b985ebdd09a73faeefeffa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "夜視無明，不離商賈。子反笑歡，與市為仇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9973cae24082dd943337f9dc0a9f91fa63819680eaad0cd160e602edb0c6a1ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a656ac474eef09f1f9160754c5af55460e834796540894325620b5a9f3f1155"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "徒行離車， 厭泥塗，利以休居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e89b3ea846a8a22f24cd4cbd63dc8d4a5ff1e8403b2bcf5f35dd36e01f1c4b40",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:381e89e1aee6c039efd8060cdfa94abc09c309be421f978ac153877ca9602f80"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "作室山根，人以為安。一夕崩巔，破我 飧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:64f79219c2fc9665d5694ebba55e440a9ae4f62b72a97ae92260264c6b942358",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:100fb645668bb7c829feb10a8227eb64a5a55d744ced7a63503587618b16bc4a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "東山西山，各自言安。雖相登望，竟未同堂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bddfbf2380270f882ec8a1a0ec7ae65f27b7faf5e57bfb27193bd3adfb67fd39",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f07ac38581aef1232c75b438d7f99cb7a70dd7e94eea687497a3aac12e5b86da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "君子在朝，凶言消去。驚駭逐狼，不見雄英。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dc6908df7d4e36da82ac0e8fa723286df763eb3320587fb9b915b3f494fd8a6f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b56b368f75112eb3dd2ef27fd42aafb5c7f7e6fe475d2906a428b0f060c7f79c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "慎慎（一作 墳墳）火燒山根。不潤我鄰，獨不蒙恩。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:121caaebcd2beef225465371f9f6c9ab2566de873b60293d597609d62d001531",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa1d5625947debe29774db59cc2dd2cd71bfd75178e2ce75521e0f71de187027"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "南山之蹊，真人所遊。德配唐虞，天命為子。保佑歆享，身受大慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24fabc539774fb73be703d2d04bec73c74473d7cbb5fcca430b0d71ee4f6f72d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a61bdd49a7a245696ca47e4508eaaa4a34c32b1bb05d549c90e32afe2115393a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "龍蛇所聚，大小來處。泱泱霈霈，淡淡磕磕。使我無賴。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd2abb43d49d67373297375bf8295a43a12b6ba34ba18e19652c7f89ad5e919e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b98262864a74744e33f6bf5a3835db53b0ecdffc4ec0e2fb0085158fb49eb7d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "旃裘若闔，慕德獻服。邊鄙不悚，以安王國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1060b6a1e9d2901fd49b338ba55424c9a647d6646f6ec44b086f6fd6b387c48e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:924fd0f414d1457eeecd2a2d82e46a5a632c2419868468d1f16a5519428cdb1b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "光體春成，陳倉雞鳴。陽明失道，不能自守。消亡為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a1863e2605772eff817ead15180dac108f2ce7a14430182c3d0ecb121234c88a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:48a8356764497dc16884c0a3ac4a936741461769947f14220ae09c0bd346327a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "下泉苞稂，十年無王。荀伯遇時，憂念周京。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9d2e19e1481eeed138e8419c522dcf5712378a5b8b9109a93f30c7e8403d4996",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c489a36aa82bb4e7e2cec8dead91d7d5ae106a9f7037ac0e549da4484ebb64e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "仁德不暴，五精就舍。四序允釐，民安其居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:717a7c6ad5cfd3bd14c3dd9c1bf912fe1fad4345dea65c7666f5f8fc16e2b18e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0fcc1b9c391fd0044749401d935d0c08a98663cbb0da4d735fe453216e89d4d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "隋和重寶，眾所貪有。相如睨柱，趙王危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:027ae7f20c28c88275a604b3884fb698e5102b17804a6ce81b04d19cdec834d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9cf47de397217c4d0a19f387ad555ceb01ff48aa9a344dc8f6b5659c3bdcc2e4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "鳳生五雛，長於南郭。君子康寧，悅樂身榮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:255812067838d9b88a134babbfbcfa256516c7b741410449d69f36233356bb7b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d9a3b9575843e0f4288bff333b69ebdd2083aa0289c342bf7f4d226f6e1b3154"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "二人為旅，俱歸北海。入門上堂，拜謁王母。勞賜我酒，女功不喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47e10eb262db78b346f8b0e74031815a7276718c475292e5588e5f0e52e87347",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b17268fa3480e1728e6a1c7a6414c706612676e2b88825d6b077fd0a24879fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "逐憂除殃，洿泥生粱，下田為王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb5e3d243c119912f7e00366e059f05f617d995e7e515e94b5cb54c9d73e63e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:489f734e824c96cb958619800d8bcc4eae32d9fc3a8cad7b855db0c2a800f668"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "東門之墠，茹藘在阪。禮義不行，與我心反。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4b0122ca201413328a184095b288c7425c72b6d350a11b4c1c7b321df1b532e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2168c38886e3cbeeceb308a63f3d869ce632bf3dd66cd9c332af496ac9e2f100"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "鳧遇稻蘆，甘樂 ，雖驅不去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c11fb9375d5ee52be1138f9bc9fc6e029d741a4fa51d9107329b50263378769",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65be5403e4f0d86cdff7a8b5a99199364b27b94d0fdc1971798ea44a32355a82"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "清人高子，久屯外野。逍遙不歸，思我君母。公子謁請，王孫嘉許。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fabd12c4022ff00f850dbabd5f5234ce7db432ed6995485dc90c33421013b645",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:565484294c4577220b709defe60bd5e0fdd29f4005b7b866856571e9dbdeff86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "讒 所言，語不成全。虎狼之患，不為我殘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02c1d59995281ff0f363028a3f1ed32b4afe9f9e1536a4641c8ff446732060e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f88d91857d3d3046a6a8962af58addcad6fd6751b89513cac7648d9f99a865f3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "張羅捕鳩，鳥麗其災。雌雄俱得，為網所賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c3a4ea422fda42c78188b5639c81d7e65623d8ac54d9c451b3c48b1c341d093",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b0abf4916c22fc01956db96b5e0496375d0099049865f512d0f39ae9faa169de"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "安仁尚德，東鄰慕義，來安吾國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:35ab2d7b84763c3f5cf842e05fa702bb28ed0010cf32e5181e22e55e1b62678d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7e77b57f346d16dcf054112d9a5bad07021879294ad3dee8a8a6364245f71aff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "猾醜假誠，前後相違。言如鱉咳，語不可知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:84b8754fdba5cc7ec05b98d3910d4455df90ad98f2bfd8cee2d488636332200b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c515495dcd3ef0a160627efa292b43b36a0d79c8276e54aa6e77d19854df254f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "懷璧越鄉，不可遠行。蔡侯兩裘，久苦流離。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:96b4e6ef79376d46d4134f5c97d916105df634b92d778fc758c0b9383875603b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c690ff821109493a4bec4b1461b729535fe46f042ff60979077b1d87dc242f0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "伯氏歸國，多所恨惑。車頓蓋傾，身常驚惶。乃得其願，雌雄相從。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c2e5c92978406a619a6799e669fe3c86f338db6813b8fe60b53cc21de9c7b9bf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:148ddb9bf0b3e6673c4c34a5371d3b23aa0bda076dacf48fb1e4c13feabcb371"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "火石相得，乾無潤澤，利少囊縮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8712af7904a0aeb3607b26d0c6cf64b02b9e05d4e3ba03d914bb396ab9188928",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:210cbd3de0c083ce72934478ab9744e8f32f407aff41784f4731709b5f531fc1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "君明聖哲，鳴呼其友。顯德之徒，可以禮仕。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b9b9c7fdeb040c4922bb8214874fd30590553d0159017dd89101a4817a46461a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eea5adcc5c746b8cc825b75b199b71e06ac9bae9e7bdd14558328e42a7a1a2c8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "騎豚逐羊，不見所望。徑涉虎廬，亡豚失羊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0a37af7baf226f8345d2fdeb6a8edb4aef2ae40ed9536ce5e4e73f7570071bd7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:550a262e9bc24fd0bd29a373340146483f858a36d27419daa6bd6af142ac8a0f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "元黃虺隤，行者勞罷。役夫憔悴，處子猥衰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:09e140437abe5d864b09fcdfd6563ce8f11e4640fe8290705cef2808c44576f0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:909cf1b107ac9588ae73eed6b308a329848ab3a71c4f950ae1b00d3dcdfe6fbb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "右手掩目，不見長叔。失其所得，悔吝相仍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:595283fa39cad325e1c71e2b86c71ff962748231cbf798cc791a8cc7580d586d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:17d974273e2b460ca37b394aa57bbce931da8a9a475a79352f3147958526cb5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 22,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "免冠進賢，步出朝門。儀體不正，賊孽為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2982cd6d69843baba5cf439bd3f5afac83bce8819facb18ecc842325b8e03b24",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fa8a233889ceb34961a4970de969058ec03e06047e42e334c80da1eec3efe4f2"
    }
  ]
}
